---
// Authentic natural emerald hero with warm honey/blossom backdrop and 4-pillar SVG trust bar
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-emerald-950 text-white">
  <img
    src="/images/hero-bg.webp"
    alt=""
    aria-hidden="true"
    width="960"
    height="640"
    loading="eager"
    decoding="async"
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center opacity-30"
  />
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-l from-emerald-950/95 via-emerald-900/85 to-emerald-950/80"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8 sm:py-14">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-7 md:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Editorial Copy -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 text-center md:text-right">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-900/90 border border-emerald-500/30 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-100 mb-3">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
          <span>من الإنتاج للبيت مباشرة — طبيعي ١٠٠٪</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold leading-snug text-white mb-3">
          منتجات الحسيني{" "}
          <span class="text-amber-300 block sm:inline">طبيعي .. أصيل .. فاخر</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-emerald-100/90 mb-6 max-w-xl mx-auto md:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
          طحينة سمسم خام على البارد، عسل نحل نقي غير مبستر، زبدة فول سوداني طبيعية، وزيت زيتون بكر ممتاز — توصيل سريع لجميع محافظات مصر.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3">
          <a
            href="#offers"
            class="rounded-xl bg-amber-400 px-6 py-2.5 sm:py-3 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-emerald-950 hover:bg-amber-300 transition-colors shadow-sm"
          >
            تصفح العروض
          </a>
          <a
            href="/products"
            data-astro-prefetch
            class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-400/40 bg-emerald-900/60 px-5 py-2.5 sm:py-3 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-800/80 transition-colors"
          >
            كل المنتجات
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Mobile Search (visible only below md) -->
        <form action="/products" method="get" class="mt-5 md:hidden max-w-sm mx-auto">
          <div class="relative">
            <input
              type="search"
              name="q"
              placeholder="ابحث عن طحينة، عسل، مختوم..."
              aria-label="ابحث في المتجر"
              class="w-full rounded-xl border border-emerald-700 bg-emerald-900/70 pr-4 pl-10 py-2.5 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-emerald-200/70 focus:border-amber-300 focus:outline-none"
            />
            <button
              type="submit"
              aria-label="بحث"
              class="absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-emerald-200"
            >
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4">
                <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8" />
                <path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3" />
              </svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- Featured Showcase -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 mx-auto w-full max-w-xs sm:max-w-sm md:max-w-full">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-emerald-400/25 bg-emerald-900/40 p-1.5 shadow-2xl">
          <img
            src="/images/hero-main.webp"
            alt="تشكيلة منتجات الحسيني الطبيعية"
            width="560"
            height="560"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="sync"
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl object-cover aspect-square"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4-Pillar Trust Bar with crisp SVG icons -->
<div class="border-b border-stone-200 dark:border-gray-800 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900/90">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-3.5 grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"/><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"/></svg>
      <span>خامات طبيعية ١٠٠٪</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0"><path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2"/><path d="M15 18H9"/><path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14"/><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"/></svg>
      <span>توصيل لجميع المحافظات</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"/><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"/></svg>
      <span>دفع بالفيزا والمحافظ الإلكترونية</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      <span>ضمان الجودة والنقاء</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
